## 🎯 Phase 2.2: Parser 구현 완료

### ✅ 구현 내용

**파일**: `src/parser.jl` (580줄)

#### AST 노드 타입 (30+)

**표현식**:
- Literal: IntegerLiteral, FloatLiteral, StringLiteral, SymbolLiteral, BooleanLiteral, NothingLiteral
- Identifier
- BinaryOp (op, left, right)
- UnaryOp (op, operand)
- Call (func, args)
- IndexAccess (object, indices)
- MemberAccess (object, field)
- TypeAnnotation (value, type)
- ArrayLiteral, TupleLiteral

**문**:
- Assignment (target, value)
- FunctionDef (name, params, return_type, body)
- IfStmt (condition, then_body, else_body)
- WhileStmt (condition, body)
- ForStmt (variable, iterator, body)
- ReturnStmt (value)
- Block (statements)

#### Parser 알고리즘

**Recursive Descent Parser** with operator precedence:

```
parseProgram
├─ parseStatement
│  ├─ parseFunctionDef
│  ├─ parseIfStmt
│  ├─ parseWhileStmt
│  ├─ parseForStmt
│  ├─ parseReturnStmt
│  ├─ parseAssignment
│  └─ parseExpressionStmt
└─ parseExpression
   ├─ parseAdditive (+, -)
   ├─ parseMultiplicative (*, /, %)
   ├─ parseUnary (-, !)
   ├─ parsePostfix ((), [], .)
   └─ parsePrimary
      (literal, identifier, parenthesized, array)
```

#### 주요 특징
- 연산자 우선순위 처리 (Precedence climbing)
- 라인 피크 (Lookahead) 기반 결정
- 예외 처리 (`expect!()` 함수)
- AST 시각화 (`ast_to_string()`)

